{{Quote|Look at you all. Scavenging like rats. How pathetic.|[[Crosshair]], to his former squad [[Clone Force 99]]|<ref name="Reunion">{{TBB|Reunion}}</ref>}}
'''Rats''' were creatures that could be found in the lower levels of the [[city]]-[[planet]] of [[Coruscant]]. Those that roamed the junkyard of [[Level 1782]] were particularly large.<ref name="SWI" /> [[Tatoo-rat]]s dwelled in the [[Boba Fett's Palace|palace]] of [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba]] the [[Hutt]] on [[Tatooine]]. When the [[droid]] partners [[C-3PO]] and [[R2-D2]] were escorted in the dungeons to face Jabba's [[EV-9D9|supervisor droid]], three tatoo-rats could be spotted on one set of prison bars.<ref name="ROTJ" /> Rat populations were sometimes kept in line by [[cat]]s.<ref name="ALD">''[[Aftermath: Life Debt]]''</ref>

Some rats were used as test specimens in laboratory experiments.<ref name="Virus">{{TCW|Blue Shadow Virus (episode)}}</ref>

"Rat" was used as a derogatory term for [[Sentience|sentients]].<ref name="SW20207">[[Star Wars (2020) 7|''Star Wars'' (2020) 7]]</ref>

==Biology and appearance==
Rats had a [[hair]]y [[Color|gray]] coat, a hairless tail that was longer than their head and body combined, and sensory whiskers on their faces. <ref name="ROTJ" />

